Redning is an original game inspired by the classic side-scrolling rescue-shooter genre. Its name, characters
(the grabbers, mutants, little humans and the player's ship), artwork, intro, sounds and code are original.
All artwork is drawn live as vector shapes on an HTML canvas; all sounds are synthesised live with the Web Audio API.

